{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFourStrands","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFourStrands","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Commute.Basic"],"declarations":76,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s2_leaks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s2_leaks","kind":"theorem","line":428,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L428-L432","doc":"**The leak is `σ₂`.** It moves the left line of `σ₁` into the right line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_keeps_lines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_keeps_lines","kind":"theorem","line":424,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L424-L426","doc":"The weak vertex on `σ₃` keeps the left and right lines of `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site1_keeps_lines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site1_keeps_lines","kind":"theorem","line":420,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L420-L422","doc":"The weak vertex on `σ₁` keeps the left and right lines of `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.letterPL_s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.letterPL_s1","kind":"theorem","line":417,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L417-L418","doc":"The left projector of `σ₁` is `PL`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_flips_back","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_flips_back","kind":"theorem","line":395,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L395-L402","doc":"The reverse direction, by the lowering operator `fJ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_flips","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site3_flips","kind":"theorem","line":385,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L385-L393","doc":"**The strand-4 weak vertex converts the `J₄` flavour, by the `sl₂` raising operator.**\nBetween `Jb` and `Ja` the insertion `weakAt − σ₃ = −h·P_L(σ₃)` is `−h/[2]` times `eJ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site2_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site2_comm","kind":"theorem","line":380,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L380-L383","doc":"See `weak_site1_comm`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site1_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weak_site1_comm","kind":"theorem","line":375,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L375-L378","doc":"A weak vertex on strand 1 or 2 keeps the `J₄` flavour: it commutes with `J₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weakAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.weakAt","kind":"def","line":371,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L371-L373","doc":"The weak vertex on a letter: `σ − h·P_L(σ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.letterPL","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.letterPL","kind":"def","line":367,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L367-L369","doc":"The left projector of a letter: `[2]⁻¹ (σ + q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":352,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L352-L359","doc":"`eJ ≠ 0`, so the `J₄` doublet is a genuine (nonzero) `sl₂`-pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_gg_vertex_mirror","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_gg_vertex_mirror","kind":"theorem","line":348,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L348-L350","doc":"… and so does its mirror `σ₂⁻¹σ₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_gg_vertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_gg_vertex","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L344-L346","doc":"The strand-4 `γγ` vertex `σ₂σ₃⁻¹` carries the `J₄` raising operator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_left_only","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_left_only","kind":"theorem","line":339,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L339-L342","doc":"The `J₄` pair is supported on the left line. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_sl2_f","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_sl2_f","kind":"theorem","line":334,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L334-L337","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_sl2_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_sl2_e","kind":"theorem","line":327,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L327-L331","doc":"`[hJ, eJ] = cJ · eJ` with `cJ = 2(q²+1)²(q⁴+1)/(q⁴+q²+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fJ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fJ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":322,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L322-L324","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":318,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L318-L320","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.three_strand_word_no_mix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.three_strand_word_no_mix","kind":"theorem","line":304,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L304-L316","doc":"**Every three-strand word keeps the `J₄` flavour**: any product of `σ₁^{±1}`,\n`σ₂^{±1}` has no `Ja ← Jb` component. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_no_mix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_no_mix","kind":"theorem","line":280,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L280-L302","doc":"**No word commuting with `J₄` mixes the `J₄` flavour.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Jb_Ja","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Jb_Ja","kind":"theorem","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L278-L278","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_Jb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_Jb","kind":"theorem","line":276,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L276-L276","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Jb_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Jb_idem","kind":"theorem","line":275,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L275-L275","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_idem","kind":"theorem","line":274,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L274-L274","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_Jb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_Jb","kind":"theorem","line":272,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L272-L272","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_J4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_J4","kind":"theorem","line":270,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L270-L270","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_add_Jb","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Ja_add_Jb","kind":"theorem","line":268,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L268-L268","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.D_ne''","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.D_ne''","kind":"theorem","line":264,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L264-L266","doc":"… and in the factored form `field_simp` produces. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.D_ne'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.D_ne'","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L259-L261","doc":"The same hypothesis in the normal form `simp` produces, for `field_simp`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s2i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s2i","kind":"theorem","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L252-L253","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s1i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s1i","kind":"theorem","line":249,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L249-L250","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s2","kind":"theorem","line":246,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L246-L247","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_comm_s1","kind":"theorem","line":243,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L243-L244","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.J4_eq","kind":"theorem","line":236,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L236-L241","doc":"Explicit form of `J₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.hJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.hJ","kind":"def","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L228-L229","doc":"`hJ = [eJ, fJ]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fJ","kind":"def","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L226-L227","doc":"`fJ = Jb σ₃ Ja`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eJ","kind":"def","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L224-L225","doc":"`eJ = Ja σ₃ Jb`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"l