oubletFour.sigma3_sl2_e","kind":"theorem","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L189-L192","doc":"`[hS, eS] = cS · eS` with `cS = 2(q⁴+1)/(q²+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fS_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.fS_eq","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L186-L187","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eS_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.eS_eq","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L183-L184","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s3_Ld","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s3_Ld","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L181-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s3_Lu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.s3_Lu","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/FlavourDoubletFourStrands.lean#L180-L180","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Lu_add_Ld","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.FlavourDoubletFour.Lu_add_Ld","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341